OL,5,G1600 Hitler: Countdown to War
OL,6,     FFresh from invading
OL,7,     FCzechoslovakia, Hitler turned to
OL,8,     Fhis next target - Poland. He saw
OL,9,     Fit this vast country as ripe for
OL,10,     FGerman expansion, taking him to
OL,11,     Fthe borders of the Soviet Union.
OL,12,G1700 The Men and the Machines That Beat
OL,13,G     Hitler
OL,14,     FMark Urban continues the story of
OL,15,     Fmen from the Fifth Royal Tank
OL,16,     FRegiment. This moving final
OL,17,     Fepisode covers D-Day, the battle
OL,18,     Ffor Normandy and eventual victory
OL,19,     Fin Germany.
